    "content": "Icing on the shitcake… despite having a brain tumor, my FMLA has been DENIED, according to my manager who isn't sure why and I have not yet received a letter from FMLA explaining why it was denied. FMLA is the family medical leave act and it protects your job from termination for missing work while dealing with a health condition. So I need to return to work BUT first I have to provide documentation from a doctor stating I am cleared …",
