        "parent_comment_id": null,
        "at_count": 0,
        "content": "You are certainly entitled to a lawyer through the Union for the FMLA I can't believe they would deny this it had to be the way the doctors wrote up their information on the paperwork and needs to be picked apart the doctors need to rewrite what they wrote so they can get this approved for you.. I had to apply for it FMLA because I have asthma at first they denied me I had to go back to the doctors and they had to go over the paperwork again and write it up a specific way so it would get accepted, and even if you have to reapply for the FMLA it is retroactive!!Don't back down, that's why u have a Union they have to represent and fight for you!!! Love u little one, u don't need the stress u have enough on your plate, I do pray for you I know things are going to work out just think positive and stay strong",
